flowchart TD
  R["Protected request"] --> V["Validate input and resolve synthetic cookie subject"]
  V --> S["Resolve current account and resource snapshots"]
  S --> D{"Shared engine returns Allow?"}
  D -->|No / unavailable| DENY["Deny: public generic response + internal audit"]
  D -->|Yes| KIND{"Requested operation"}
  KIND -->|Attempt| A["Snapshot-bound read or atomic draft CAS"]
  KIND -->|Course administration| G["Current active grant bound to course and capability"]
